# Raw local AI review transcripts, delegate patches, and scratch probes.
# The whole directory is ignored, not selected patterns. These files quote source
# — including the licensed licensor document — and must never reach a commit, a
# push, or GitHub. Delegate wrappers also refuse to save a review while this path
# is committable. Replaces three narrower patterns that left ~300 files exposed.
.ai/reviews/

.vercel
.env*.local

# Teams notification cert material (PRIVATE KEY — never commit)
oracle-teams-cert/
